MODEL WEIGHTS AND TRAINING DATA

The model weights produced by this repository are released under the same MIT
terms. They are trained on the datasets listed in data/dataset_manifest.json,
each of which keeps its own licence:

  * IITB English-Hindi corpus (via kumardeepak/nmt-anuvada) - MIT repository
    licence, upstream corpus intended for research use.
  * Project Gutenberg selections (via nltk_data) - public domain.
  * Hinglish-TOP dataset (Google Research) - Apache-2.0 / CC-BY-4.0.
  * HDRS Hindi dialogue corpus (skmalviya) - MIT.
  * ANKIT authored seed conversations - MIT (same as this file).

Redistributing this model means redistributing a derivative of those datasets;
preserve their attribution requirements.
